<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Guidant started as neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Guidant started as neutral.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guidant Corp was started with a neutral rating by Vector Securities analyst David Gruber, Vector said.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are initiating coverage of Guidant with a neutral rating based solely on valuation concerns,&quot; Gruber said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the medical devices maker were 3/4 to 76.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
